B.U8=new A.h4("Bro. Vinod Somepalli","Bro. Vinod exemplifies compassionate care, dedicating himself to nurturing the church family. He shepherds with a thoughtful and prayerful approach, ensuring every member feels supported and cherished in their walk with Christ.","assets/church/elder_vinod.jpg","(630) 854-7335")
